# Local research captures and development coordination are not public source.
# research/ is ignored as a whole. That already covers what used to be listed
# one by one: downloaded comparison tools (research/artifacts), raw scan reports
# (research/*.json), the UI fixture and the benchmark fixtures and output
# (research/benchmark*). Git cannot re-include a file under an excluded
# directory, so narrower patterns below research/ would never take effect.
research/
